SUMMARY:BizCon Business Expo & Conference Toronto 2026 - VIP Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us at 
 BizCon Business Expo & Conference Toronto on Tuesday June 23\, 2026 for a 
 great opportunity to learn from expert Featured Speakers\, network with ot
 her event guests and meet over 70 exhibitors and sponsors.\n\n\\*BizCon is
  organized and hosted by Better Events Management. GTApreneurs’ is proud
  to sponsor this exciting event for the 3rd time.\n\n\\*Hundreds of entrep
 reneurs and small business owners expected.\n\nThis is a VIP ticket\, whic
 h includes a light afternoon lunch + beverages + Guest Contact sheet email
 ed to you in the day or two after the event (includes only information for
  those who register through our website)\n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gta
 preneurs.com/networking-events-toronto\n\n**VENUE:** Grand Cinnamon Banque
 t & Convention\n**ADDRESS:** 3895 McNicoll Ave\, Scarborough\, ON M1X 0C1\
 n**PARKING:** Free\, onsite.\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **1:00-2:00pm:**
  Featured Speaker Presentations\n* **2:00-5:00pm:** B2B Tradeshow\n\n**TIC
 KETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking 
 Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $30\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go he
 re to view our memberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-
 networking-memberships\n\n\\*Exhibitor tables available. Contact us to rec
 eive $100 off a BizCon Toronto 2026 Exhibitor Booth\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT T
 HE EVENT?**\nCall or text Tammy at (416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com.
 \n\n\\*We will EMAIL you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET that includes only those 
 who register for the event through our website\, in the day or two after t
 he event. If you don’t receive it in your inbox\, please check your SPAM
 /JUNK folder. Note: You must attend the event and check in at the GTAprene
 urs’ booth to receive the guest contact sheet.
