SUMMARY:GTApreneurs July 21\, 2026 Summer Business Networking Event Richmo
 nd Hill
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  an exciting Business Networking Event in Richmond Hill on Tuesday July 21
 \, 2026 where you can meet potential clients and referral partners\, learn
  something new\, and promote your business!\n\n* Fruit\, veggie tray and s
 nacks provided by GTApreneurs\n* Free wine samples from VinBon\n\nThis eve
 nt will feature Guest Speaker and owner of VinBon\, **Michael (Mike) Perre
 lla**. Vin Bon is Ontario’s largest Boutique Micro Winery\, crafting cus
 tom\, small-batch wines from fresh imported juice — no water added\, min
 imal preservatives\, and fully vegan. With nearly 40 years of experience\,
  Vin Bon delivers premium craft wine at a fraction of retail prices\, back
 ed by a 100% guarantee.\n\nContact **VinBon** at (647) 985-0633 or info@vi
 nbon.ca and visit www.vinbon.com to learn more about their products and se
 rvices.\n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-ri
 chmond-hill\n\n**VENUE:** VinBon Richmond Hill\n**ADDRESS:** 10620 Yonge S
 t\, Richmond Hill\, ON\n**PARKING:** Free\, onsite.\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:*
 *\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking\n* **7:00-7:02pm:** GTApreneurs pr
 esentation\n* **7:02-7:10pm:** Mike Perella presentation: ***“What are t
 he best wines to go with your favorite foods?”***\n* **7:10-8:00pm:** Op
 en networking\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibito
 r and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $25 in advance o
 r $27 on event day\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view our member
 ships and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-membership
 s\n\n\\*The day after the event\, we will email you the Guest Contact Shee
 t. If you don’t receive it by 5pm\, check your junk folder. Note: You mu
 st attend the event to receive the guest contact sheet.\n\n**QUESTIONS ABO
 UT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text us at (416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com
 .
